                    "copy": "ODDWORLD and all other Oddworld trademarks used herein, including ODDWORLD INHABITANTS, the OW Oddworld Logo, Oddworld: Soulstorm, and ABE are the proprietary trademarks and trade names of Oddworld Inhabitants, Inc. (c)2020 All rights reserved.",
